# Auto-generated by Android Studio / `updateDaemonJvm` — pins the Gradle
# daemon to whatever JDK is on the machine that generated it (confirmed:
# toolchainVersion matched this machine's Android-Studio-bundled JDK 25
# exactly). Committing this would force CI (which intentionally uses JDK
# 21 — see android-ci.yml) to fight with it. Machine-specific, not a
# project setting.
gradle/gradle-daemon-jvm.properties

